<% content_for :title, "Data deletion" %>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Export:</strong> website › Settings › Export data (JSON with your home's data), or in the app.</li>
  <li><strong>Reset the home's data (owner only):</strong> deletes the installation's devices, automations and history. The account, members and plan stay.</li>
  <li><strong>Delete the account:</strong> website › Settings › Delete account, or in the app. If you are the last member,
      the whole installation is deleted with it.</li>
</ul>
<p>Can't access your account? Write to <a href="mailto:herlonfilgueira@gmail.com">herlonfilgueira@gmail.com</a> from the registered e-mail.</p>
